# KSV014 / readOnlyRootFilesystem: The frontend (Nuxt/Nitro) writes temporary
# files to the container filesystem at runtime. The container runs as non-root
# with all capabilities dropped and seccomp RuntimeDefault applied.
KSV014

# AVD-KSV-01010 / sensitive ConfigMap keys: NITRO_PORT is a TCP port number,
# not a secret. Trivy's heuristic false-positives on the "PORT" substring.
AVD-KSV-01010

# GO-2026-5932 / golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp unmaintained: golang.org/x/crypto
# is an indirect dependency only; no code imports openpgp (or any x/crypto
# subpackage). No fixed version exists — the package is permanently deprecated.
GO-2026-5932

# GHSA-cp6q-959q-f8rh / @tiptap/core mergeAttributes prototype pollution:
# tiptap is only pulled in as an unmet optional peer of @nuxt/ui, itself a
# transitive dep of the nuxt-site-config devtools layer (from @nuxtjs/sitemap
# and @nuxtjs/robots). No app code imports @tiptap or renders a rich-text
# editor, so the vulnerable mergeAttributes() path is never reached. Bumping
# it clean requires forcing pnpm to re-resolve the whole @nuxt/ui peer tree,
# which rewrites most of pnpm-lock.yaml for a package that isn't used.
GHSA-cp6q-959q-f8rh

# CVE-2026-93687 / braces DoS via deeply nested patterns: no fixed version
# exists. braces is only reached through build-time glob tooling (tailwindcss 3,
# chokidar, fast-glob) on developer-controlled patterns, never request input.
CVE-2026-93687

# CVE-2026-85393 / node-forge signature forgery: no fixed version exists.
# Only pulled in by listhen (via @nuxt/cli and nitropack) to mint the local dev
# server's self-signed HTTPS cert; not used for signature verification at runtime.
CVE-2026-85393

# CVE-2026-86597 / gosnowflake writes sensitive information to logs: no fixed
# version exists. The driver is only used by the mentorship-sync CronJob, which
# never enables gosnowflake debug logging.
CVE-2026-86597

# CVE-2026-102826 / CVE-2026-102827 / CVE-2026-102828 / CVE-2026-102829:
# simple-git (and its argv-parser) command-guard bypasses. The only fix is the
# 4.x major, which @nuxt/devtools 3.x cannot load (default import removed), so
# nuxt prepare fails. simple-git is reached only via the devtools dev server,
# which is not part of the production build.
CVE-2026-102826
CVE-2026-102827
CVE-2026-102828
CVE-2026-102829
